/*
  Outputs
    Check output name with `niri msg outputs`.
    https://niri-wm.github.io/niri/Configuration:-Outputs

    Output scale and rotation has to be taken into account for positioning.
    For example, a 3840×2160 output with scale 2.0 will have a logical size of
    1920×1080, so to put another output directly adjacent to it on the right,
    set its x to 1920. If the position is unset or results in an overlap, the
    output is instead placed automatically.
*/

// Dell P2016 (1440 x 900)
output "DP-1" {
    // off
    // scale 1
    position x=0 y=0
}

// Dell XPS (1280 x 800)
output "LVDS-1" {
    // off
    // scale 1
    position x=-1280 y=0 // left
    // position x=1440 y=0 // right
    // position x=0 y=900 // down
    // position x=0 y=-900 // up
}
